      "autoHeightenLevel": 5,
      "cantrips": [],
      "lv1spells": [],
      "lv2spells": [
        {
          "name": "Detect Alignment (Good Only) (At Will)",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "heightenedLevel": 2,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "detection",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "",
          "area": "30ft emanation",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Your eyes glow as you sense aligned auras. Choose chaotic, evil, good, or lawful. You detect auras of that alignment. You receive no information beyond presence or absence. You can choose not to detect creatures or effects you're aware have that alignment.</p>\n<p>Only creatures of 6th level or higher-unless divine spellcasters, undead, or beings from the Outer Sphere-have alignment auras.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> You learn each aura's location and strength.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "54fksB6rqAuZumrD"
        },
        {
          "name": "Deafness",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "heightenedLevel": 2,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "fortitude",
          "description": "<p>The target loses hearing; it must attempt a Fortitude save. The target is then temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is Deafened for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Deafened for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Deafened permanently.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "8XT4jHAwVhHhZl7q"
        },
        {
          "name": "Invisibility (At Will) (Self Only)",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "heightenedLevel": 2,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "illusion",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "10 minutes",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Cloaked in illusion, the target becomes Invisible. This makes it Undetected to all creatures, though the creatures can attempt to find the target, making it Hidden to them instead. If the target uses a hostile action, the spell ends after that hostile action is completed.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The spell lasts 1 minute, but it doesn't end if the target uses a hostile action.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "fXt0yd6ktNmXBaqu"
        }
      ],
      "lv3spells": [
        {
          "name": "Sound Burst",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "heightenedLevel": 3,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "sonic"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "10ft burst",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "fortitude",
          "description": "<p>A cacophonous noise blasts out, dealing 2d10 sonic damage. Each creature must attempt a Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is Deafened for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is Deafened for 1 minute, and is Stunned 1.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "Xtsp6Jvr4Hb1fzjb"
        },
        {
          "name": "Agonizing Despair",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 3,
          "heightenedLevel": 3,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "emotion",
            "fear",
            "manipulate",
            "mental"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "60 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "will",
          "description": "<p>Your target's mind tumbles down a deep well of dread, dwelling so intently on deep-seated fears that it's painful. The target takes 4d6 Mental Damage damage with a Will saving throw.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and becomes Frightened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and becomes Frightened 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and becomes Frightened 3.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by 2d6 Mental Damage.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "QyX6TVBVz9KtkUu0"
        },
        {
          "name": "Blindness",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 3,
          "heightenedLevel": 3,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "incapacitation",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "fortitude",
          "description": "<p>You blind the target. The effect is determined by the target's Fortitude save. The target then becomes temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is Blinded until its next turn begins.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Blinded for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Blinded permanently.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "HGmZX99yyEedZUpw"
        }
      ],
      "lv4spells": [
        {
          "name": "Dimension Door",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 4,
          "heightenedLevel": 4,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "teleportation"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "120 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Opening a door that bypasses normal space, you instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to a clear space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you-even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container-the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "rMO2LkDgd3DoRYOm"
        },
        {
          "name": "Divine Wrath",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 4,
          "heightenedLevel": 4,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "sanctified",
            "spirit"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "120 feet",
          "area": "20ft burst",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "fortitude",
          "description": "<p>You channel the fury of divinity against your foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is Sickened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is Sickened 2; while it's sickened, it's also Slowed 1.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "ua5zc2wcPQasXFns"
        }
      ],
      "lv5spells": [
        {
          "name": "Speak with Animals (Constant)",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "heightenedLevel": 5,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "10 minutes",
          "range": "",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals. The spell doesn't make them more friendly than normal. Cunning animals are likely to be terse and evasive, while less intelligent ones often make inane comments.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "TFfCLY3ncKfL4GFE"
        },
        {
          "name": "Tongues (Constant)",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 5,
          "heightenedLevel": 5,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "1 hour",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>The target can understand all words regardless of language and also speak the languages of other creatures. When in a mixed group of creatures, each time the target speaks, it can choose a creature and speak in a language that creature understands, even if the target doesn't know what language that is.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "zT2X2SAyoAb6SNY0"
        }
